{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "25", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "10", "M": "19", "S": "44"}}, "news": [{"title": "Schindler India launches new experience centre in Gurugram; reinforcing our commitment to sustainable urban mobility", "para": "Schindler India has unveiled its new Experience Centre in Gurugram, highlighting advancements in vertical mobility solutions. During the launch, a panel of experts deliberated on creating sustainable, interconnected urban spaces in the Delhi-NCR region by 2030. They stressed the importance of transit-oriented development, walkable neighborhoods, and eco-friendly construction practices, while also calling for supportive policies. Schindler reaffirmed its commitment to Net Zero and introduced an environmentally conscious maintenance contract.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/brand-connect-initiative/schindler-india-launches-new-experience-centre-in-gurugram-reinforcing-our-commitment-to-sustainable-urban-mobility/133500835?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-78140/133500835.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "brand-connect-initiative"}, {"title": "Property tax powers Chandigarh civic body's \u20b9134 crore own revenue haul", "para": "During the months of April to June, property tax became a cornerstone of the Chandigarh municipal corporation's finances, yielding over Rs 134 crore in revenue. This surge was partly due to timely rebates provided to taxpayers. The civic authority, however, faced expenses of Rs 254 crore, primarily from salaries. A notable amount was dedicated to crucial development initiatives, particularly in road construction and upgrades.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/property-tax-powers-chandigarh-civic-bodys-134-crore-own-revenue-haul/133493794?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-112024/133493794.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Gurugram: 450 families in Imperia Esfera rely on diesel generator set as snag sparks outages", "para": "The inhabitants of Imperia Esfera in Gurgaon are facing an ongoing nightmare of power outages that have persisted for three days, impacting about 450 residences. Continuous electrical issues have rendered their temporary 11-kV power connection inefficient. In a bid for clarity and permanence, residents are calling for a collaborative investigation to pinpoint responsibility.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/gurugram-450-families-in-imperia-esfera-rely-on-diesel-generator-set-as-snag-sparks-outages/133493654?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-72744/133493654.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}